<!--[if true]><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="width:600px;direction:ltr"><tr><![endif]-->
<div class="kl-row colstack" style="display:table;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;">
<!--[if true]><td style="vertical-align:top;width:600px;"><![endif]-->
<div class="kl-column" style="display:table-cell;vertical-align:top;width:100%;">
<div class="mj-column-per-100 mj-outlook-group-fix component-wrapper" style="font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;vertical-align:top;width:100%;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="width:100%;" width="100%">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="" style="vertical-align:top;padding-top:9px;padding-right:18px;padding-bottom:9px;padding-left:18px;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="" width="100%">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td align="left" class="kl-text" style="font-size:0px;padding:0px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;word-break:break-word;">
<div style="font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#393939;"><div> </div>
<p data-end="349" data-start="330">Hi <span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: Arial, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif;">{!Lead.Name}</span>,</p>
<p data-end="413" data-start="351">We’re excited to share some great news — <strong data-end="412" data-start="392">FRE has expanded</strong>!</p>
<p data-end="707" data-start="415">As a valued partner already carrying FRE, you know the power of offering a premium nicotine pouch that customers come back for again and again. Now, we’ve added <strong data-end="608" data-start="576">3mg and 6mg strength options</strong> to our lineup — giving your shoppers even more variety and control over their nicotine experience.</p>
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="font-size: 0px; font-family: Times; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left; height: 96px;" width="100%">
<tbody>
<tr style="height: 96px;">
<td align="left" class="kl-text" style="font-size: 0px; width: 100%; height: 96px;">
<div style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 150%; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(57, 57, 57); text-align: left;">
<div><strong><strong class="font-bold">What's New:</strong></strong></div>
<div> </div>
<div><strong>3 MG &amp; 6MG Nicotine Strengths:</strong></div>
<div>
<ul data-end="953" data-start="743">
<li data-end="818" data-start="743">
<p data-end="818" data-start="745" style="padding-bottom:0">Perfect for customers just starting out or looking for a lighter option</p>
</li>
<li data-end="896" data-start="819">
<p data-end="896" data-start="821" style="padding-bottom:0">Over <strong data-end="894" data-start="861">172 million cans sold in 2024</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-end="953" data-start="897">
<p data-end="953" data-start="899" style="padding-bottom:0">Mint, Wintergreen &amp; Original — our top flavors — available now</p>
</li>
<li data-end="1032" data-start="972">
<p data-end="1032" data-start="974" style="padding-bottom:0">Strong enough to satisfy, smooth enough for everyday use</p>
</li>
<li data-end="1073" data-start="1033">
<p data-end="1073" data-start="1035" style="padding-bottom:0">Driving <strong data-end="1071" data-start="1043">70%+ category growth YoY</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-end="1133" data-start="1074">
<p data-end="1133" data-start="1076">Currently the most purchased strength across the market</p>
<p data-end="1133" data-start="1076" style="padding-bottom:0">All strengths maintain our signature <strong data-end="1208" data-start="1173">moist, flavor-rich pouch design</strong> that keeps customers loyal — and buying again. In fact, <strong data-end="1298" data-start="1265">6 in 10 FRE customers reorder</strong> regularly.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<div><strong><strong class="font-bold">What this means for you:</strong></strong></div>
<div>
<ul>
<li data-end="1486" data-start="1415">
<p data-end="1486" data-start="1417" style="padding-bottom:0"><strong data-end="1453" data-start="1417">Greater appeal across user types</strong> — new, moderate, and experienced</p>
</li>
<li data-end="1523" data-start="1487">
<p data-end="1523" data-start="1489" style="padding-bottom:0">Expanded <strong data-end="1523" data-start="1498">Planogram flexibility</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-end="1591" data-start="1524">
<p data-end="1591" data-start="1526" style="padding-bottom:0">More <strong data-end="1551" data-start="1531">repeat purchases</strong> driven by personal strength preferences</p>
</li>
</ul>
<div>
<p data-end="1711" data-start="1593">We're here to help you make the most of this expansion with updated <strong data-end="1678" data-start="1661">POS materials</strong>, samples, and marketing support.</p>
<p data-end="1799" data-start="1713">Let’s talk about updating your inventory or getting these new strengths on your shelf.</p>
<p data-end="1942" data-start="1801" style="padding-bottom:0">Best,</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
